    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02658",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“燕子！燕子！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Swallow! Swallow!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02658",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "那声音嘶哑，哽噎在咽喉里，说不定名人这时才觉察到自己的身体尚未恢复常态。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His voice was hoarse, choked in his throat; perhaps only then did the Master realize that his body had not yet returned to normal.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02658",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "老名人经常发生这样的事。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Things like this often happened to the old Master.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02658",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "名人使我感到亲切，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The Master made me feel close to him,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02658",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "也许是他当时的形象深深地浸透了我的心吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "perhaps because the image of him at that moment had sunk deeply into my heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
